# Claude Code plugins to install via the native plugin manager.
#
# Each line: <plugin>@<marketplace>  <marketplace_source>
#   - <plugin>@<marketplace>  passed to `claude plugin install`
#   - <marketplace_source>    passed to `claude plugin marketplace add`
#                             (github repo "owner/name", URL, or path)
#
# Marketplaces are deduped and registered once before any plugin install.
# This installs commands, agents, hooks, skills, and MCP servers — the
# whole plugin — unlike `npx skills add` which only installs skill files.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

superpowers@superpowers-marketplace                obra/superpowers-marketplace
blueprints@gianchub-plugins                        gianchub/claude-plugins
ecc@ecc                                            affaan-m/everything-claude-code
code-simplifier@claude-plugins-official            anthropics/claude-plugins-official
swift-lsp@claude-plugins-official                  anthropics/claude-plugins-official
rust-analyzer-lsp@claude-plugins-official          anthropics/claude-plugins-official
review-pr-changes@mmcardle-ai-skills               mmcardle/ai-skills
visual-qna@mmcardle-ai-skills                      mmcardle/ai-skills
